32Z","value":5,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=4793370","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-2842310-1846651706691402","game_id":"steam-2842310","kind":"announcement","title":"Among Us Story Demo At Steam Next Fest","summary":"Operators - this is an emergency! You can try the demo of our new single player, narrative adventure, Among Us Story: On Guard right now as a part of Steam Next Fest. Dive into a new experience in the Among Us universe and meet your new crew, stand up for justice, and of course - catch that pesky Impostor!Jump into our completely safe and MIRA HQ approved demo simulator now before Steam Next Fest is over on October 26th. And if you enjoyed the demo, be sure to wishlist the game now! You'll be ab","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:00:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691402","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:24:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2842310-1846018067930618","game_id":"steam-2842310","kind":"announcement","title":"Among Us Story: On Guard at LudoNarraCon","summary":"Attention Operators! You can step into the simulator and try the demo for our new single player, narrative adventuere, Among Us Story: On Guard, as a part of LudoNarraCon. Be sure to hop in now because the demo will only be available for a limited time. We hope you love this new adventure - it let's you experience the universe of Among Us in a whole new way, with a whole new crew. You'll be able to get your hands on it when it releases on February 17th, 2027! While you wait, remember to wishlist","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T17:00:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067930618","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:24:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2842310-1846018067930340","game_id":"steam-2842310","kind":"announcement","title":"Among Us Story: On Guard arrives February 17, 2027!","summary":"Get excited Operators!You'll get your chance to play Among Us Story: On Guard and hop into the MIRA HQ training simulator on February 17, 2027!!! Check out the reveal date trailer below, it shows off some brand new tasks and what investigating will look like:The team still has some cooking to do. We're putting the finishing touches, a garnish if you will, on the game so you get the perfect experience. We can't wait for you to experience Among Us like this! You can wishlist the game right now on ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T16:04:02Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067930340","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:24:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2842310-1843481262702151","game_id":"steam-2842310","kind":"announcement","title":"Among Us Story: On Guard going to Triple-i on October 8th!","summary":"Gather around, Crewmates! Triple-i Initiative is coming back October 8th at 9am PT / 6pm CEST, and we're gonna be there with some exciting news(!!!) about Among Us Story: On Guard. Tune in for some nonstop gaming with 45 mins of trailers, world premieres, demo drops and more from other indie studios like us. You can watch the event on YouTube, Twitch, and right here on Steam. Keep those visors peeled and we'll see you at the show! Dors","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-14T16:00:09Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262702151","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:24:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2842310-1835236783571319","game_id":"steam-2842310","kind":"announcement","title":"Among Us Story: On Guard Demo Available Now","summary":"A NEW GAME COMING?!It's only been 6 days, 6 hours, and 37 minutes since the reveal, but you weren't counting, right? It's time to try out our new game Among Us Story: On Guard yourself!Stop your current task and play the demo now before it's gone June 22nd.Among Us Story: On Guard is an all-new narrative adventure set in the Among Us universe. As the newest member of MIRA R&D, you'll step into the simulator to take part in our Crewmate training program. You'll learn to identify Impostors (there ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-15T17:00:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835236783571319","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:24:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-2842310":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:13:50Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:13:50Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-2842310":"2026-10-26T10:13:50Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"2842310":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:13:50Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T10:13:50Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:13:50Z"},"4793370":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:13:50Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T10:13:50Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:13:50Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-2842310","app_id":2842310,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:10Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"de5270675dbfd3232f961bea7da2a3a368a6a04a482eb23848ea6b9796a6fd1d","response_sha